# One Roof — Cursor Agent Rules

Always read and follow [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) before performing any work.

## Reading Order
1. `Docs/01_GAME_VISION.md`
2. `Docs/02_ARCHITECTURE.md`
3. `Docs/03_DATA_CONTRACTS.md`
4. The active task in `Planning/BACKLOG.md`
5. The latest handoff in `Handoffs/Active/`

## Key Boundaries
- Domain is pure C# (`noEngineReferences: true`, no UnityEngine).
- Application exposes read-only projections and ports (`noEngineReferences: true`).
- Presentation binds pooled views to projections via entity IDs.
- Never hand-edit `.meta` files without valid GUIDs. Commit every asset with its `.meta`.
- Create or update handoff in `Handoffs/Active/` upon task completion.
